---
title: Sehat Saheli Architecture
---

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph CLIENT["📱 Client (PWA / Browser / Mobile)"]
        UI[Next.js PWA]
        LocalDB[(Local Cache / Service Worker)]
        UI --> LocalDB
    end

    subgraph EDGE["⚡ CDN / Edge"]
        CDN[CDN / Edge Cache]
    end

    subgraph LB["🌐 Load Balancer & API Gateway"]
        LBNode[Load Balancer]
        APIGW[API Gateway / Reverse Proxy]
        LBNode --> APIGW
    end

    subgraph APP["🧭 Application Layer"]
        Auth[Auth Service]
        UserSvc[User Service]
        ConsentSvc[Consent Service]
        TasksSvc[Tasks Service]
        AIGateway[AI Gateway Service]
        Notif[Notification Service]
        FileSvc[File Service]
    end

    subgraph INFRA["☁️ Infrastructure & Storage"]
        Postgres[(Postgres Primary + Replicas)]
        Redis[(Redis Cache / Session)]
        S3[(Object Storage - S3 / GCS)]
        Queue[(Kafka / SQS)]
        DW[(Data Warehouse)]
    end

    UI -->|Requests| CDN
    CDN --> LBNode
    APIGW --> Auth
    APIGW --> UserSvc
    APIGW --> ConsentSvc
    APIGW --> TasksSvc
    APIGW --> AIGateway
    APIGW --> Notif
    APIGW --> FileSvc

    ConsentSvc --> Postgres
    TasksSvc --> Redis
    UserSvc --> Postgres
    AIGateway -->|async| Queue
    Notif --> Queue
    Queue -->|workers| Postgres
    FileSvc --> S3
    Postgres --> DW

    classDef infra fill:#f9f9f9,stroke:#ddd
    class INFRA infra
```
